'<!-- Two perpendicular harmonic motions $x = A\sin(a t + \delta)$, $y = B\sin(b t)$ overlaid to recreate classic [Lissajous oscilloscope figures](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lissajous_curve). -->
#hide
#rad
PlotHeight = 400
PlotWidth = 400
#end hide
'Equation:
x(θ) = sin(a*θ)
y(θ) = sin(b*θ)
#UI 'Coefficient a -'a = 2', Coefficient b -'b = 3
#post
$Plot{x(θ)|y(θ) @ θ = 0 : 2*π}
#end post
